msgstr "Aller à la page du plugin sur WordPress.org"

#: includes/wpematicohk_settings.php:385
msgid "Thanks for test, use and enjoy this plugin."
msgstr "Merci de tester, d'utiliser et d'apprécier ce plugin."

#: includes/wpematicohk_settings.php:386
msgid ""
"If you like it and want to thank, you can write a 5 star review on Wordpress."
msgstr ""
"Si vous l'aimez et souhaitez nous remercier, vous pouvez écrire un avis 5 "
"étoiles sur WordPress."

#: includes/wpematicohk_settings.php:390
msgid "Click here to rate the plugin on Wordpress"
msgstr "Cliquez ici pour noter le plugin sur WordPress"

#: includes/wpematicohk_settings.php:390
